    "category": "Indicator",
    "type_designations": ["1080"],
    "module_designation": null,
    "description": "Weighing indicator, as part of a non-automatic weighing instrument, designated the 1080. Designed to be used as part of a Class III or IIII non-automatic weighing instrument; self-indicating, DC-powered and operates as a single interval instrument. Comprises processor and converter unit (CPU and A/D converter), LED display with 7 digits, LED indicators, operator keypad and metallic enclosure. Devices: semi-automatic zero setting, zero tracking, semi-automatic subtractive tare weighing, automatic tare weighing, determination of stability of equilibrium, accumulation, counting, target weighing, checkweighing, axle weighing, and gross/net/tare/print/zero/motion/accumulation/over-under weight/network indicators. Interfaces: load cell 6-wire shielded connection, RS232, RS485, Ethernet, USB, Profibus DP, Digital I/O, DeviceNet."
  },
